-- Tests for pc-body-a-deferred.l4: Penal Code 1871, Chapter 16, ss 301, 304B, 304C,
-- 308A, 310, 311, 314, 315, 316 and 335A, completed in the pass of 2026-11-04.
--
-- Where the expected values come from.
--
-- * The structural cases (the first part) are generated by
--   generators/deferred/gen_struct_tests.py from spec_a_tests.py, which restates
--   each offence's elements as a formula over the facts record's leaves, written
--   from the Code's words (the raw line numbers are in the spec).  For each
--   offence: a set of facts meeting every element (one per alternative of an
--   "or"), one set per element with that element alone made untrue, and a set
--   with nothing established.  The expected values are not read from output: an
--   offence is made out exactly when every element is, the charge states the
--   section, the offence's name and the punishment words copied from the Code,
--   and a charge that cannot be framed has no text and a refusal.  They test that
--   the L4 says what the spec says; they cannot find a spec that misreads the
--   text.
-- * The cases written by hand (the second part) are the Code's Illustrations and
--   Explanations (cited above each), both sides of every threshold, the
--   definitions and rules of reading (s 304B(2), s 304C(5), s 315(2), s 335A(3)
--   and (4)), the hypothetical in s 316, s 301(1) over a nested Homicide Facts,
--   and the exact words of a charge.
-- * A failing assertion is a finding.  None has been edited to match the code.
-- By one Sonnet 5.5 agent, 2026-11-04.  The text is the converter's plain-text rendering of Singapore Statutes Online ("Current version as at 09 Sep 2026"), not the official text.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pc-domain`
IMPORT `pc-general`
IMPORT `pc-body-a-life`
IMPORT `pc-exceptions-private-defence`
IMPORT `pc-body-a-deferred`

§ `body-a deferred tests`

`the particulars` MEANS Particulars WITH
    accused            IS "Tan Ah Kow"
    date               IS "the 1st day of March 2025"
    time               IS "9.30 pm"
    place              IS "Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3"
    `co-accused`       IS ""
    `common intention` IS FALSE

`the victim` MEANS Person WITH
    name           IS "Lim Mei Ling"
    `described as` IS ""
    pronoun        IS she
    kind           IS `a human being`

